      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a117d69041774e64883c4a1f3ddec85b, type: 2}
      text: Prep work?
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
      text: "\u201CI bought a bunch of flowers and strawberries from Joe."
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
      text: Thanks for being friends with him by the way, he said I can pay him later.
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
      text: "Anyway, once I\u2019m out of here, I\u2019m going to reserve us a spot
        at the fancy restaurant down the street."
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
      text: "Then I\u2019ll get some fancy clothes, make myself look presentable
        and all that."
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a117d69041774e64883c4a1f3ddec85b, type: 2}
      text: "Seems like you got it all figured out. I\u2019m happy for you."
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
      text: Thanks. Anyway, I should be off. Can you get me one of those Romance
        smoothies?
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
